# Three subjects side by side: the doctor works in the practice software and in billing, the patient in the
# appointment portal and in billing. Billing therefore moves to the middle, against the order of declaration,
# and every actor stands between two neighbouring subjects.
diagram usecase "Klinik" subtitle="Drei Systeme, Akteure zwischen benachbarten Grenzen" locale=de
actor patient "Patient"
actor arzt "Ärztin"
actor kasse "Krankenkasse" kind=system
subject termin "Terminportal"
usecase buchen "Termin buchen" in termin
usecase absagen "Termin absagen" in termin
subject praxis "Praxissoftware"
usecase befund "Befund erfassen" in praxis
usecase rezept "Rezept ausstellen" in praxis
subject abrechnung "Abrechnung"
usecase abrechnen "Leistung abrechnen" in abrechnung
usecase pruefen "Abrechnung prüfen" in abrechnung
rel patient -- buchen
rel patient -- absagen
rel arzt -- befund
rel arzt -- rezept
rel patient -- pruefen
rel abrechnen -- kasse
rel arzt -- abrechnen
